            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "In case someone's just looking for a quick copy-paste solution, here's an example:\r\n```lua\r\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(\"BufWritePre\", {\r\n  group = 'MiniTrailspace',\r\n  callback = function()\r\n    MiniTrailspace.trim()\r\n    MiniTrailspace.trim_last_lines()\r\n  end\r\n})\r\n```\r\n\r\n@echasnovski Do you think that it would be worth including this in the docs?",
